      "key": [
        "Ad astra abyssosque"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Katheryne: Regional Greetings",
      "content": "In Liyue she is surprised by the Traveler's surprise. In Inazuma she jokes about teleporting. In Fontaine she asks whether she looks like a masterpiece of the Fontaine Research Institute. In Natlan she calls it an adventurer's paradise. In Nod-Krai she warns of factions at the border. In Snezhnaya she warns of the cold and the Shadow Realm.",
